    "Copyright © the FFmpeg developers. AetherEngine reads films with FFmpeg, built with dav1d, zimg and libzvbi as dynamically linked frameworks from github.com/superuser404notfound/FFmpegBuild (version 3.6.0), and reads Dolby Vision with libdovi from github.com/superuser404notfound/LibDovi. Their licences follow, each in full." : {
      "comment" : "Licence credit for the FFmpeg libraries. Keep the versions, names and web addresses as they are",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copyright © the FFmpeg developers. AetherEngine liest Filme mit FFmpeg, gebaut mit dav1d, zimg und libzvbi als dynamisch gelinkte Frameworks von github.com/superuser404notfound/FFmpegBuild (Version 3.6.0), und liest Dolby Vision mit libdovi von github.com/superuser404notfound/LibDovi. Ihre Lizenzen folgen, jeweils vollständig."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copyright © the FFmpeg developers. AetherEngine lee las películas con FFmpeg, compilado con dav1d, zimg y libzvbi como frameworks enlazados dinámicamente desde github.com/superuser404notfound/FFmpegBuild (versión 3.6.0), y lee Dolby Vision con libdovi desde github.com/superuser404notfound/LibDovi. Sus licencias figuran a continuación, completas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copyright © the FFmpeg developers. AetherEngine lit les films avec FFmpeg, compilé avec dav1d, zimg et libzvbi en frameworks liés dynamiquement depuis github.com/superuser404notfound/FFmpegBuild (version 3.6.0), et lit le Dolby Vision avec libdovi depuis github.com/superuser404notfound/LibDovi. Leurs licences suivent, chacune en entier."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copyright © the FFmpeg developers. AetherEngine legge i film con FFmpeg, compilato con dav1d, zimg e libzvbi come framework collegati dinamicamente da github.com/superuser404notfound/FFmpegBuild (versione 3.6.0), e legge il Dolby Vision con libdovi da github.com/superuser404notfound/LibDovi. Le loro licenze seguono, ciascuna per intero."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copyright © the FFmpeg developers. AetherEngineはFFmpegで映画を読み込みます。FFmpegはdav1d、zimg、libzvbiとともに、github.com/superuser404notfound/FFmpegBuild（バージョン3.6.0）の動的リンクフレームワークとしてビルドされています。Dolby Visionはgithub.com/superuser404notfound/LibDoviのlibdoviで読み込みます。各ライセンスの全文を以下に掲載します。"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copyright © the FFmpeg developers. AetherEngine leest films met FFmpeg, gebouwd met dav1d, zimg en libzvbi als dynamisch gekoppelde frameworks van github.com/superuser404notfound/FFmpegBuild (versie 3.6.0), en leest Dolby Vision met libdovi van github.com/superuser404notfound/LibDovi. Hun licenties volgen, elk volledig."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copyright © the FFmpeg developers. O AetherEngine lê os filmes com o FFmpeg, compilado com dav1d, zimg e libzvbi como frameworks vinculados dinamicamente a partir de github.com/superuser404notfound/FFmpegBuild (versão 3.6.0), e lê Dolby Vision com o libdovi de github.com/superuser404notfound/LibDovi. As licenças vêm a seguir, cada uma completa."
